],"gloss":"blossomed"},{"surface":"கருங்கால்","parts":[{"text":"கரும்","lemma":"கருமை","gloss":"black"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"trunk"}],"gloss":"black-trunked"},{"surface":"வேங்கை","parts":[{"text":"வேங்கை","lemma":"வேங்கை","gloss":"Vēṅkai tree"}],"gloss":"Vēṅkai tree"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மேக்கெழு","parts":[{"text":"மேக்கு","lemma":"மேக்கு","gloss":"upwards"},{"text":"எழு","lemma":"எழு","gloss":"rising"}],"gloss":"rising upwards"},{"surface":"பெருஞ்சினை","parts":[{"text":"பெரும்","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"large"},{"text":"சினை","lemma":"சினை","gloss":"branch"}],"gloss":"large branch"},{"surface":"இருந்த","parts":[{"text":"இருந்த","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"perched / stayed"}],"gloss":"perched"},{"surface":"தோகை","parts":[{"text":"தோகை","lemma":"தோகை","gloss":"peacock"}],"gloss":"peacock"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பூக்கொய்","parts":[{"text":"பூக்கொய்","lemma":"பூக்கொய்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மகளிரிற்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிரிற்","lemma":"மகளிரிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றோன்று","parts":[{"text":"றோன்று","lemma":"றோன்று","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாடன்","parts":[{"text":"நாடன்","lemma":"நாடன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தகாஅன்","parts":[{"text":"தகாஅன்","lemma":"தகான்","gloss":"unworthy man"}],"gloss":"unworthy man"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"தான்","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"himself"}],"gloss":"himself"},{"surface":"தீது","parts":[{"text":"தீது","lemma":"தீது","gloss":"evil / bad things"}],"gloss":"evil"},{"surface":"மொழியினும்","parts":[{"text":"மொழியினும்","lemma":"மொழி","gloss":"even if he speaks"}],"gloss":"even if he speaks"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தன்","parts":[{"text":"தன்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"one's own"}],"gloss":"one's own"},{"surface":"கண்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"eye"},{"surface":"கண்டது","parts":[{"text":"கண்டது","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"what was seen"}],"gloss":"what was seen"},{"surface":"பொய்க்குவது","parts":[{"text":"பொய்க்குவது","lemma":"பொய்","gloss":"will it lie"}],"gloss":"will it lie"},{"surface":"அன்றே","parts":[{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"அன்று","gloss":"it is not so"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed it is not so"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தேக்கொக்கு","parts":[{"text":"தேக்கொக்கு","lemma":"தேக்கொக்கு","gloss":"teak buds"}],"gloss":"teak buds","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அருந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"அருந்தும்","lemma":"அருந்து","gloss":"eating"}],"gloss":"eating"},{"surface":"முள்ளெயிற்று","parts":[{"text":"முள்","lemma":"முள்","gloss":"sharp / thorn-like"},{"text":"எயிற்று","lemma":"எயிறு","gloss":"having teeth"}],"gloss":"having sharp teeth"},{"surface":"துவர்வாய்","parts":[{"text":"துவர்","lemma":"துவர்","gloss":"red / coral-colored"},{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"mouth"}],"gloss":"red mouth"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வரையாடு","parts":[{"text":"வரை","lemma":"வரை","gloss":"mountain"},{"text":"ஆடு","lemma":"ஆடு","gloss":"playing / moving"}],"gloss":"playing on the mountain"},{"surface":"வன்பறழ்","parts":[{"text":"வன்பறழ்","lemma":"வன்பறழ்","gloss":"strong young cub"}],"gloss":"strong young cub","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தந்தை","parts":[{"text":"தந்தை","lemma":"தந்தை","gloss":"father"}],"gloss":"father"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடுவனும்","parts":[{"text":"கடுவன்","lemma":"கடுவன்","gloss":"male monkey"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"the male monkey too"},{"surface":"அறியும்","parts":[{"text":"அறியும்","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"knows"}],"gloss":"knows"},{"surface":"அ","parts":[{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"that"}],"gloss":"that"},{"surface":"கொடியோனையே","parts":[{"text":"கொடியோன்","lemma":"கொடியோன்","gloss":"cruel man"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"accusative case marker"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"that cruel man indeed"}]}],"literal":"Fully blossomed black-trunked Vēṅkai tree's / upward-rising large branch perched peacock / flower-plucking women-like appearing lord of the land, / like an unworthy man, himself evil even if he speaks, / what my own eye saw, will it lie? It is not so! / Teak buds eating, sharp-toothed, red-mouthed, / mountain-playing strong young cub's father, / the male monkey too knows that cruel man!","translation":"Even if the lord of the land—where peacocks perched on the high, large branches of the black-trunked Vēṅkai trees, fully blossomed without buds, look like women plucking flowers—speaks unkindly like an unworthy man, what my own eyes have seen cannot be a lie! Even the male monkey, the red-mouthed, sharp-toothed father of the strong little cub playing on the mountain slopes, who feeds on teak buds, knows that cruel man.","modern":"அரும்புகள் இல்லாதவாறு முழுமையாக மலர்ந்த கரிய அடிமரத்தைக் கொண்ட வேங்கை மரத்தின் உயர்ந்த பெரிய கிளையில் அமர்ந்திருக்கும் மயில், பூக்களைப் பறிக்கும் பெண்களைப் போலத் தோன்றும் நாட்டின் தலைவன், ஒரு தகுதியில்லாதவனைப் போலத் தானே தீய சொற்களைக் கூறினாலும், என் கண்கள் நேரில் கண்ட காட்சி பொய்யாகிவிடாது. தேக்கு மரத்தின் மொட்டுகளை உண்ணும், கூர்மையான பற்களையும் சிவந்த வாயையும் உடைய, மலையில் விளையாடும் வலிமையான குட்டியின் தந்தையாகிய ஆண் குரங்கும் அந்த இரக்கமற்ற தலைவனை நன்கு அறியும்.","explanation":"The friend (தோழி) speaks to the heroine (தலைவி) to reassure her of the hero's secret visits and his love, even though he currently seems to delay marriage or speak words that cause anxiety. She asserts that what her own eyes have witnessed cannot be denied. The poem is set in the Kuriñci (mountain) landscape, where the Vēṅkai tree in full bloom signifies the season of love and marriage. The peacock perched on the branch resembles a woman plucking flowers, enhancing the beauty of the scene. The male monkey (கடுவன்), who feeds on teak buds and cares for his young cub on the slopes, is presented as a silent witness to the hero's secret path, implying that the hero's presence is known even to the wild creatures of the mountain and he cannot escape his commitment.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.8],[0.8,1.6],[1.6,2.0],[2.0,3.5],[3.5,4.1],[4.1,4.2],[4.2,4.5],[4.5,6.1],[6.1,6.2],[6.38,7.1],[7.1,7.5],[7.5,8.8],[8.8,9.16],[9.21,9.6],[9.6,10.1],[10.1,11.4],[11.4,11.5],[11.5,12.83],[13.21,13.39],[13.39,13.77],[13.77,14.72],[14.72,14.72],[14.72,15.6],[15.6,16.63],[17.14,17.4],[17.4,17.7],[17.7,19.1],[19.1,19.2],[19.2,20.1],[20.1,20.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,0.9],[0.9,1.7],[1.7,2.2],[2.2,2.2],[2.2,4.2],[4.2,4.3],[4.3,4.6],[4.6,6.4],[6.4,6.55],[6.55,6.55],[6.55,6.55],[6.55,6.6],[6.6,9.87],[9.93,10.4],[10.4,10.9],[10.9,12.4],[12.4,12.4],[12.4,13.73],[14.11,14.29],[14.29,14.67],[14.67,15.62],[15.62,15.62],[15.62,16.5],[16.5,18.0],[18.0,18.0],[18.0,19.41],[19.83,20.24],[20.24,20.66],[20.66,20.66],[20.66,21.9]]}}